prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Complainant(s) most respectfully pray(s) that this Hon'ble Authority may graciously be pleased to:

a) Direct the Respondent-Promoter to {primary_relief — handover possession / refund consideration with interest / complete promised amenities};

b) Direct the Respondent-Promoter to pay interest at the prescribed rate (SBI MCLR + 2%) from {commencement_date} till the date of actual possession / refund as the case may be, under Section 18(1) of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016;

c) Direct the Respondent-Promoter to pay compensation of Rs. {compensation_claimed}/- under Section 18(3) of the Act for the mental harassment and financial loss suffered by the Complainant(s);

d) Direct the Respondent-Promoter to comply with the terms of the Agreement for Sale and the provisions of the Act;

e) Impose penalty upon the Respondent-Promoter under Sections 59-64 of the Act for the violations specified above;

f) Award costs of the present complaint;

g) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Authority may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Complainant(s) shall ever pray.
